<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">You&#39;ve got the wrong person.</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.800" end="00:00:07.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, your eyes are just like mine, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.500" style="s2">that&#39;s you in the picture.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.135" end="00:00:13.155" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.030" end="00:00:20.800" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.700" end="00:00:20.800" style="s2">Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.890" end="00:00:26.910" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.700" end="00:00:37.400" style="s2">Daddy, I&#39;ve been looking for you</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.100" end="00:00:40.000" style="s2">forever. My tail hurt from swimming so</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.400" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">much, but Mia still found daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:44.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong person. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.000" end="00:00:47.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, your eyes are just like mine, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.500" end="00:00:47.600" style="s2">that&#39;s you in the picture.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:50.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Jasper,</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.100" end="00:00:51.500" style="s2">the security footage just showed you</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.200" end="00:00:52.800" style="s2">being attacked by an unidentified</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.500" end="00:00:55.100" style="s2">object.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.800" end="00:00:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not an unidentified object. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.100" end="00:01:00.700" style="s2">I&#39;m here to find my daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.400" end="00:01:00.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, her eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.300" end="00:01:05.300" style="s2">Apparently, any random kid can get right</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.190" end="00:01:06.700" style="s2">[music] in front of me and call me daddy</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:08.100" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.700" end="00:01:10.400" style="s2">Should I notify the police and have them</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.100" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">take her home?</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.400" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">Take her upstairs, find out who her</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.000" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">mother is, [music] then we&#39;ll talk.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.400" end="00:01:18.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going? You&#39;re not leaving</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:18.700" style="s2">me, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.000" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s just hard to get along with. He</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.900" end="00:01:31.200" style="s2">must be scared, just like I was when I</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.400" end="00:01:36.200" style="s2">first met him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.200" end="00:01:36.200" style="s2">I finally found daddy. I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.900" end="00:01:41.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me your mother&#39;s number. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.800" end="00:01:44.100" style="s2">calling her right now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.900" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call her. Mommy will be mad. She</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.100" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">doesn&#39;t know I snuck out to find you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.200" end="00:01:52.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your mother&#39;s name?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:55.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serafina.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.300" end="00:01:57.400" style="s2">Mommy says you know her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.300" end="00:02:01.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.400" end="00:02:01.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is mommy. Look again.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong [music] person.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.392" end="00:02:11.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.492" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">But mommy says I&#39;m allergic to mangoes</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.592" end="00:02:16.192" style="s2">because I got it from daddy. She also</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.892" end="00:02:19.192" style="s2">says daddy always drinks triple espresso</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.192" end="00:02:21.192" style="s2">with no sugar and he hates tomatoes. He</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.192" end="00:02:22.492" style="s2">won&#39;t eat even a little bit.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.192" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">And when daddy&#39;s working, he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.492" end="00:02:24.756" style="s2">like anyone standing within 10 ft of</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:24.992" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.756" end="00:02:26.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.992" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, an outsider couldn&#39;t possibly know</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.492" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">those things.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.996" end="00:02:32.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.192" end="00:02:34.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And there&#39;s a scar behind your ear.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.192" end="00:02:34.992" style="s2">Mommy says you got</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.592" end="00:03:02.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serafina, jewelry designer. She&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.292" end="00:03:04.192" style="s2">Paris for a jewelry show. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.992" end="00:03:05.192" style="s2">something else.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.192" end="00:03:07.192" style="s2">I traced her name through our records</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.192" end="00:03:08.692" style="s2">and found an old file from 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.192" end="00:03:10.092" style="s2">5 years ago, someone using that name</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.692" end="00:03:11.292" style="s2">came to Voss Group. You weren&#39;t here at</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:13.292" style="s2">the time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.292" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">Find every visitor, call, and person</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.292" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">involved from 5 years ago. I want all of</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:19.192" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.292" end="00:03:19.192" style="s2">Don&#39;t miss a single word.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.192" end="00:03:27.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s true. Daddy really [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.792" end="00:03:29.992" style="s2">really forgot mommy completely.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.392" end="00:03:29.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.092" end="00:03:40.792" style="s2">Those eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.092" end="00:03:44.092" style="s2">You made that exact face whenever you</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.792" end="00:03:44.092" style="s2">threw a tantrum as a child.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.392" end="00:03:49.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry for the delay. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.492" end="00:03:55.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, that&#39;s you and that &#39;s my mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.192" end="00:03:57.292" style="s2">You two knew each other before. You</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.692" end="00:04:00.092" style="s2">forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.292" end="00:04:01.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One photograph can&#39;t prove anything.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.092" end="00:04:04.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But mommy has has has half of the shell</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.894" end="00:04:06.694" style="s2">pendant, and you have the other half.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.094" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">They&#39;re yours together.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.694" end="00:04:11.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shell pendants can be bought.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:12.994" style="s2">They can be copied.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.294" end="00:04:15.194" style="s2">Who told you to come here? Tell me the</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.994" end="00:04:16.794" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.194" end="00:04:18.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one did.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.794" end="00:04:20.894" style="s2">I missed daddy so much. I found my way</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.894" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">here myself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.894" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you kept a child [music] here</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.294" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">and interrogated her for hours.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.194" end="00:04:31.828" style="s2">Those eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.294" end="00:04:34.894" style="s2">You made that exact face whenever you</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.828" end="00:04:37.194" style="s2">[music] threw a tantrum as a child.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:38.994" style="s2">Jasper, a five-year-old girl comes to</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.194" end="00:04:41.094" style="s2">your door alone, and your first move is</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.994" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">to interrogate her?</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.094" end="00:04:43.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, I can&#39;t [music] just accept</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.194" end="00:04:46.094" style="s2">someone whose identity hasn&#39;t been</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.494" end="00:04:46.094" style="s2">confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.494" end="00:04:50.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to decide [music] that</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.494" end="00:04:51.994" style="s2">just by saying so. Sterling, call the</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.894" end="00:04:53.594" style="s2">family doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.994" end="00:04:55.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What for, ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.594" end="00:04:55.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A DNA</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.594" end="00:05:30.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just swab the inside of your cheek</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.094" end="00:05:32.294" style="s2">twice, like brushing your teeth.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.294" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? It won&#39;t hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.294" end="00:05:34.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just to be sure.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.594" end="00:05:36.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.494" end="00:05:38.094" style="s2">what if I&#39;m [snorts] not your daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.694" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why we do the test. No one should</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.094" end="00:05:41.794" style="s2">jump to conclusions, not even you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.394" end="00:05:44.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I stay here until the results come</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.794" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">back? I won&#39;t make any noise. I&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.394" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">sit in the corner. I came all this way</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.094" end="00:05:50.094" style="s2">by myself just to find you. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.994" end="00:05:52.994" style="s2">stay.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.094" end="00:05:55.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit over there. Don&#39;t touch anything.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.994" end="00:05:55.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.694" end="00:06:04.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be nervous, sweetheart. No shots,</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.494" end="00:06:05.795" style="s2">no blood draw.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.294" end="00:06:07.995" style="s2">We just swab the inside of your cheek</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.795" end="00:06:09.895" style="s2">twice, like brushing your teeth. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.995" end="00:06:11.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? It won&#39;t hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.895" end="00:06:12.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re afraid of brushing your teeth,</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.295" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">but you dare to storm onto [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.795" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">Jasper&#39;s private island</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.895" end="00:06:41.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you be here tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.895" end="00:06:42.195" style="s2">When the report comes back, will you be</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.095" end="00:06:44.095" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.195" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.095" end="00:06:47.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.395" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">The child doesn&#39;t need much, just that</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.295" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.295" end="00:06:55.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Jasper,</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.895" end="00:06:57.995" style="s2">there&#39;s something I need to mention.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.895" end="00:07:00.495" style="s2">There&#39;s a marker in this child&#39;s sample</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.995" end="00:07:02.895" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen before.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.495" end="00:07:02.895" style="s2">Be clear.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.095" end="00:07:07.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you promised yesterday I could stay</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.695" end="00:07:08.895" style="s2">until the report came back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.595" end="00:07:09.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staying doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;m having lunch</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.895" end="00:07:10.595" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.195" end="00:07:13.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staying means we&#39;re having lunch</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.595" end="00:07:13.095" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.395" end="00:07:41.995" style="s2">But you promised yesterday I could stay</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.995" end="00:07:43.195" style="s2">until the report [music] came back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.995" end="00:07:43.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staying doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;m having lunch</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.195" end="00:07:44.995" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.495" end="00:07:47.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staying means we&#39;re having lunch</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.995" end="00:07:47.495" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.295" end="00:07:53.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear that? [music] The child&#39;s logic is</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.295" end="00:07:56.495" style="s2">clearer than yours.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.295" end="00:07:56.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel [music] this afternoon&#39;s meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.095" end="00:08:02.995" style="s2">Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.740" end="00:08:03.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.995" end="00:08:04.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.695" end="00:08:06.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buy a child-sized life jacket</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.795" end="00:08:07.595" style="s2">immediately and everything a</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.095" end="00:08:08.897" style="s2">five-year-old needs, clothes, [music] a</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.595" end="00:08:10.997" style="s2">bed,</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.897" end="00:08:13.097" style="s2">Have it all delivered to the estate.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.997" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">How many and which brands? Get the best.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.097" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">Have it there today.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.897" end="00:08:21.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The report [music] isn&#39;t even back yet</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.397" end="00:08:25.297" style="s2">you&#39;ve already prepared everything.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.897" end="00:08:26.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are we going home now?</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.297" end="00:08:28.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report isn&#39;t back yet. She can&#39;t call me</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.797" end="00:08:30.497" style="s2">that not yet [music] until the report</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.297" end="00:08:30.497" style="s2">comes</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.497" end="00:08:51.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy and I are neighbors now. The walls</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.997" end="00:08:52.897" style="s2">are so thin. When it thunders, I&#39;ll tap</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.397" end="00:08:55.297" style="s2">on the wall and you&#39;ll know I&#39;m here,</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.897" end="00:08:55.297" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.297" end="00:09:04.097" style="s2">Daddy, you don&#39;t eat tomatoes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.597" end="00:09:06.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One picked [music] them out to the left,</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.797" end="00:09:09.097" style="s2">the other to the right. At least they</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.997" end="00:09:10.497" style="s2">sorted them neatly. Tell the kitchen to</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.097" end="00:09:11.797" style="s2">order fewer tomatoes from [music] now</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.497" end="00:09:13.297" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.797" end="00:09:16.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like tomatoes because I got it</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.297" end="00:09:16.497" style="s2">from daddy. Mommy says daddy never eats</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.097" end="00:09:18.097" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.497" end="00:09:19.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inherited.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:20.997" style="s2">This kid somehow turns every</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.197" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">conversation back to that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.997" end="00:09:24.097" style="s2">Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.697" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The young lady&#39;s room [music] is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.097" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">Right this way.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.897" end="00:09:29.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m [snorts] not staying in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.097" end="00:09:29.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t like this room?</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.201" end="00:09:32.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.697" end="00:09:33.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want this room. It&#39;s next to yours.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.097" end="00:09:34.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.197" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s going to storm [music] tonight too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.697" end="00:09:38.997" style="s2">If there&#39;s thunder, I&#39;ll be scared all</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:40.897" style="s2">by myself. If I&#39;m closer [music] to you,</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.997" end="00:09:43.897" style="s2">I won&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.897" end="00:09:45.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The room next door is empty anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.897" end="00:09:48.097" style="s2">Go get the bedroom [music] next to his</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.297" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">ready. She can stay there tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get it ready.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.471" end="00:09:54.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.897" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy and I are neighbors now. The walls</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.297" end="00:09:57.997" style="s2">are so thin. When it thunders, [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.497" end="00:10:00.397" style="s2">tap on the wall and you&#39;ll know I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.997" end="00:10:02.661" style="s2">here, right?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.397" end="00:10:02.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go to sleep. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.597" end="00:10:07.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already know the answer in your</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.997" end="00:10:07.397" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.397" end="00:10:10.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say you&#39;re five and can sleep by</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.598" end="00:10:13.398" style="s2">yourself? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.398" end="00:10:15.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s thundering. This isn&#39;t my home and</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.398" end="00:10:17.698" style="s2">mommy isn&#39;t here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.198" end="00:10:20.798" style="s2">I&#39;m five. I [music] sleep by myself and</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.698" end="00:10:20.798" style="s2">I&#39;m not scared at all.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.598" end="00:10:34.198" style="s2">This isn&#39;t my home. Mommy&#39;s If I cry, no</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.398" end="00:10:34.198" style="s2">one will hear me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.998" end="00:10:51.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say you&#39;re five and can sleep</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.398" end="00:10:52.898" style="s2">by yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.398" end="00:10:56.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s thundering.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.898" end="00:10:58.282" style="s2">This isn&#39;t my home and mommy isn&#39;t here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.698" end="00:11:01.798" style="s2">I&#39;m scared I&#39;ll fall asleep, wake</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.282" end="00:11:01.798" style="s2">[music] up, and daddy will be gone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.298" end="00:11:10.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take you back home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.198" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.698" end="00:11:43.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I found Seraphina&#39;s contact</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.898" end="00:11:46.598" style="s2">information.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.198" end="00:11:46.598" style="s2">Would you like me to contact her now?</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.898" end="00:11:55.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.798" end="00:11:57.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car is already on its way to the</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.798" end="00:12:00.398" style="s2">estate. [music] It should arrive in</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.798" end="00:12:00.398" style="s2">about 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.498" end="00:12:17.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That soon?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.848" end="00:12:22.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.799" end="00:12:22.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She should know where you are.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.983" end="00:12:31.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.399" end="00:12:34.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.499" end="00:12:36.099" style="s2">mommy&#39;s here. Is she going to take me</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.099" end="00:12:37.999" style="s2">away right away? [music] I just found</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.099" end="00:12:39.699" style="s2">you. We haven&#39;t even celebrated a</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.999" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">birthday together, and we haven&#39;t made a</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.699" end="00:12:43.099" style="s2">lot of pinky promises [music] yet. Can</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.699" end="00:12:44.399" style="s2">you not hit me yet?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.099" end="00:12:46.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If your mommy can&#39;t find you, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.399" end="00:12:49.599" style="s2">worry about you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.999" end="00:12:49.599" style="s2">No one&#39;s answering.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.299" end="00:12:56.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.799" end="00:12:57.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The [music] expedited DNA test result</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.199" end="00:12:59.199" style="s2">came in early. The car is already on its</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.899" end="00:13:00.999" style="s2">way to the estate and should arrive in</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.199" end="00:13:04.599" style="s2">about 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.999" end="00:13:06.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the result of the test? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.599" end="00:13:09.899" style="s2">What if it says I&#39;m not his daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.499" end="00:13:09.899" style="s2">Will he make me leave right away?</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.599" end="00:13:18.499" style="s2">Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.899" end="00:13:18.499" style="s2">if that paper says I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.599" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can call you daddy now, right?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.099" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me that as many times as you want.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.499" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, you&#39;re my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.201" end="00:14:21.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.301" end="00:14:21.501" style="s2">really true? You really are my daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.101" end="00:14:26.201" style="s2">Daddy, I can call you daddy now, right?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.601" end="00:14:28.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me that [music] as many times as</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.201" end="00:14:28.501" style="s2">you want.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.301" end="00:14:32.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I won&#39;t have to secretly live in a</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.101" end="00:14:35.801" style="s2">corner anymore? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.601" end="00:14:35.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The whole building is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.901" end="00:14:39.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s mommy. Mommy&#39;s calling.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.601" end="00:15:14.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my fault. Don&#39;t blame the child.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.501" end="00:15:16.801" style="s2">She came a long [music] way on her own</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.101" end="00:15:16.801" style="s2">just to find me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.001" end="00:16:22.502" style="s2">Grandma, [music] she said she came</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.602" end="00:16:23.702" style="s2">looking for me five years ago, but my</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.502" end="00:16:26.102" style="s2">people drove her away. I don&#39;t remember</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.702" end="00:16:26.102" style="s2">any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.402" end="00:17:55.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy says if you think about other</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.202" end="00:17:57.902" style="s2">things [music] while you eat, the food</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.102" end="00:17:57.902" style="s2">gets cold.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.503" end="00:18:37.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can&#39;t work while we&#39;re eating.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:39.903" style="s2">Mommy says if you think about other</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.703" end="00:18:41.003" style="s2">things while you eat, the food gets</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.903" end="00:18:42.803" style="s2">cold.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.003" end="00:18:44.803" style="s2">And eating cold food makes your tummy</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.803" end="00:18:45.903" style="s2">hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.803" end="00:18:48.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.903" end="00:18:50.543" style="s2">Daddy will listen to you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.303" end="00:18:51.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s a piece for you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.543" end="00:18:53.603" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.703" end="00:18:55.903" style="s2">Is this the phone you use to catch bad</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.603" end="00:18:58.303" style="s2">guys?</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.903" end="00:19:00.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I found it. 5 years ago on November</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.303" end="00:19:02.603" style="s2">12th, Miss Serafina did visit Voss Group</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.503" end="00:19:03.703" style="s2">headquarters. Her visitor registration</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.603" end="00:19:04.903" style="s2">is still on file.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.703" end="00:19:06.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who received her?</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.903" end="00:19:07.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.603" end="00:19:09.203" style="s2">The name of the staff member who</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.703" end="00:19:11.703" style="s2">received her that day was manually</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.203" end="00:19:11.703" style="s2">deleted.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.603" end="00:19:16.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only want these [music] two. This</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.703" end="00:19:17.403" style="s2">color is like what mommy wears when she</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.603" end="00:19:18.703" style="s2">paints.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.403" end="00:19:19.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The only blank entry in the entire</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.703" end="00:19:21.003" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.503" end="00:19:22.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the system logs, the deletion</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.003" end="00:19:23.303" style="s2">time, and the account used?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.203" end="00:19:25.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The audit trail was scrubbed, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.303" end="00:19:26.803" style="s2">too. Anyone with that level of access to</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.103" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">the group&#39;s back end is no ordinary</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.803" end="00:19:30.103" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.903" end="00:19:32.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, what kind [music] of person could</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.103" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">secretly erase the fact that you and</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:36.203" style="s2">mommy met?</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.903" end="00:19:38.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who knew no one would ever think</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.203" end="00:19:38.503" style="s2">to look up</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.803" end="00:19:54.603" style="s2">Wrap up everything on this rack that</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.003" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">will fit her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.603" end="00:19:58.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not [music] everything. That&#39;d be such a</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.703" end="00:19:59.603" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.303" end="00:20:01.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s got money.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.603" end="00:20:03.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if we can afford [music] it, we</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.303" end="00:20:05.203" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t waste money. Mommy says</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.603" end="00:20:07.903" style="s2">clothes you can&#39;t wear all of are a</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.203" end="00:20:07.903" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.803" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">I only want these two. [music] This</p>
