<p begin="00:20:13.703" end="00:20:16.403" style="s2">paints.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.103" end="00:20:22.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not for kid. Serafina raised her to</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.278" end="00:20:24.105" style="s2">[music] be this way all on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.403" end="00:20:26.905" style="s2">All right. These two then.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.105" end="00:20:26.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.905" end="00:20:30.205" style="s2">Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.005" end="00:20:31.605" style="s2">that woman was a bad guy [music] in</p>
