<p begin="00:20:31.605" end="00:20:34.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.905" end="00:20:49.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, we found the receptionist [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.105" end="00:20:49.705" style="s2">who worked here back then. She remembers</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.405" end="00:20:50.305" style="s2">that day.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.705" end="00:20:51.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.305" end="00:20:52.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said a young woman was waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.805" end="00:20:54.705" style="s2">you at the front desk [music] on</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.605" end="00:20:55.205" style="s2">November 12. She waited a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.705" end="00:20:56.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.205" end="00:20:58.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then a woman came downstairs claiming to</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.905" end="00:20:59.805" style="s2">be your personal secretary. She said</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.705" end="00:21:01.405" style="s2">you&#39;d arranged for her to receive the</p>
