<p begin="00:21:01.405" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">young [music] woman away.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.405" end="00:21:04.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say that again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:06.129" style="s2">Who came downstairs?</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.705" end="00:21:07.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman. She claimed to be your personal</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.129" end="00:21:09.005" style="s2">[music] secretary.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.205" end="00:21:11.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling, my personal secretary 5 years</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.005" end="00:21:12.605" style="s2">ago was Ronald Gabble.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.605" end="00:21:13.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronald is a man.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.605" end="00:21:15.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have never had a female [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.605" end="00:21:16.605" style="s2">secretary, not once.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.505" end="00:21:18.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.605" end="00:21:19.205" style="s2">that woman was a bad guy in disguise,</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.305" end="00:21:20.505" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.205" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.505" end="00:21:23.005" style="s2">Someone impersonated one of my staff and</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:23.705" style="s2">took your mommy away right in front of</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.005" end="00:21:25.505" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.705" end="00:21:26.434" style="s2">So she really did come that day.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.505" end="00:21:27.505" style="s2">She didn&#39;t just abandon me without</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.434" end="00:21:28.605" style="s2">[music] a word.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.505" end="00:21:31.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have the receptionist sketch that</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.605" end="00:21:33.505" style="s2">woman&#39;s face. And whoever could pose as</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:34.905" style="s2">my secretary back then could tamper with</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.505" end="00:21:37.305" style="s2">that back end record.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.905" end="00:21:37.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.405" end="00:21:41.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, we&#39;ll definitely [music] find</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.905" end="00:21:42.605" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.405" end="00:21:46.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.605" end="00:21:46.205" style="s2">This time, no one gets away.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.205" end="00:21:49.705" style="s2">An envelope?</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.705" end="00:21:51.205" style="s2">What kind of envelope?</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.705" end="00:21:53.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.205" end="00:21:53.505" style="s2">Bulging.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.706" end="00:22:27.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.900" end="00:22:37.106" style="s2">[music] what happened?</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.106" end="00:22:39.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About 15 minutes later, the lady came</p>
